{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rise to King Ortler</strong> is a turn-based, family-friendly board game with elements of strategy and randomness \u2013 inspired by classics like <i>Ludo</i>, but with far more interaction and variety. Move your characters across dynamic game boards, use items, and master unique maps with their own rules and effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In campaign mode, you'll gradually unlock 8 different maps \u2013 each featuring new mechanics and challenges. Once unlocked, these maps become available in Free Play mode, where you can fully customize your match: Choose the number of players (1\u20134), assign human or AI opponents, and select your preferred map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A special feature is the built-in <strong>name editor</strong>, allowing you to give your characters custom names to bring your matches to life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd11 <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Turn-based board game with elements of strategy and randomness </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f 8 unlockable maps with unique rules and special tiles </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 Items and events that dynamically change the course of the game </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddcd\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Up to 4 human or AI players in local multiplayer (including Remote Play Together) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u270f\ufe0f Custom character naming via the integrated name editor </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc6a Family-friendly visuals \u2013 colorful, humorous, and featuring lighthearted fantasy action</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"250 Matches Lost","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3679500/07725ff17240f1b3fce55ce95f3f2e853964582c.jpg"},{"name":"250 Matches Won","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstati